<title>ESTONIA: C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 19/20.</title>
<headline>C.BANK FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 19/20.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Tuesday set</p>
<p>the following exchange rates for August 19/20. The kroon is</p>
<p>pegged at eight kroons to a German mark.</p>
<p>	     August 19/20  August 18/19</p>
<p>    CZK     0.42944	 0.42838</p>
<p>    DKK     2.09992	 2.10026</p>
<p>    FIM     2.67419	 2.6689</p>
<p>    GBP    23.66066	23.38012</p>
<p>    HUF     0.07434	 0.07408</p>
<p>    LTL     3.67516	 3.62775</p>
<p>    LVL    25.1283	 24.91919</p>
<p>    RUR     0.00253	 0.0025</p>
<p>    SEK     1.82233	 1.82581</p>
<p>    UAH     7.93736	 7.83371</p>
<p>    USD    14.6988	 14.5092</p>
<p>    XEU    15.74535	15.71491</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
